   "design": "Electronic lab reports flow into the surveillance system, so the epidemiologist checks matched cases instead of typing notifications. A query in the surveillance system counts cases by disease and week against alert thresholds, instead of a spreadsheet. The report template fills the counts and the epidemiologist writes the interpretation. Reading guidance and notifications, calls, team discussions, checking, sending and outbreak contact stay with the epidemiologist. No model decides what is a case.",
